find: .map(|item| redact_reserved(key, item))
replace: .map(Clone::clone)
caught-by:
    cineris-config::it imports::a_hand_written_server_is_shown_by_the_same_rule

[break] the-guess-keeps-a-list-of-its-own
rule: The guess for a reserved section reads the import's one list of a credential's words.
